CM_ SG_ 1637 TF_Mute_Msg_Code "Tells the mute reason
0 = Phonecall (Telephone voive)
1 = Speech Recognition active (SDS active e.g. voice prompts)
2 = Emergency Call
3 = beep-signal (Signal tone)
4 = Operator Call
5 = Ringing
6 = Phonecall wideband voice
    (e.g. UMTS min 100H";
CM_ SG_ 1637 TF_Phone_active_call "Phone status, call active (call in progress)
0 = no active call  
1 = call active ";
CM_ SG_ 1637 TF_Phone_err_fieldstrength "Signal strength not available or error: if set, 
then the field strength is not determinable 
and the field strength information of 
TF_Phone_FieldStrength is invalid.";
CM_ SG_ 1637 TF_Phone_Error_Flag "State of CIB error memory 
0 = Error memory is empty  
1 = Error memory is not empty (mindestens ein Kundendienstfehlerspeicher  
